TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution hydrothermal solution
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mmol/kgw
    C 0.5 as HCO3
    Mn 1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0e6 0.001
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -pe true
END
